{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.kiriko.hand",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "贩卖会前的绷带",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.kiriko.hand",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.kiriko.hand",
    "idolId": "kiriko",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "哇……！这是 L'Antica 的新周边……呢……！",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，做得挺好的吧？今天贩卖会就要亮相了。",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "嗯……和想象的一样……！大家应该会喜欢的……",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我先去准备。霧子再等一会儿就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "那个……如果不麻烦的话……",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "我也……能帮忙吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "本来想让你待机的……不过，只是简单的事的话没关系。谢谢。",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "好、好的……！",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "那个……这些花……要摆在哪里呢……？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "放在那边桌子旁边吧。……等等，这跟刚才的是同一种花吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "啊，那个……不一样的。虽然都是蔷薇科……但种类是──",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……原来是这样。那就都放同一张桌子吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……对、对不起……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……糟了，时间好像不够了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "制作人先生，不好意思……又是我……这个架子要放在哪里……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这种事你自己判断就好，不用每次都问我。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "可、可是……如果放错地方，会给您添麻烦的……",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不会添麻烦。先按霧子觉得对的方式做做看。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "好、好的……我明白了……！",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……是不是说得太重了。她是在替我着想啊。）",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嘶、好痛。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "制作人先生……！怎么了……！血、流了好多……！",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没事，只是被刀划了一下而已。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "应、应急处理……！急救箱……还有湿毛巾……！",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "不、不行！万一细菌进去、变得更严重的话……",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "……太好了，止住血了……",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "最后……把绷带缠上……这样……",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（动作很利落……霧子真厉害啊。）",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "痛痛……飞走吧……！",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "好、好了……！可能还会痛一会儿……",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦……缠得真漂亮。第一次因为绷带佩服一个人。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "没、没有那种事……不过……太好了……",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……还有，刚才对不起。我有点急，话说重了。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "那、那种事……！",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "我……很多事情都做不好，所以……",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "现在只想着……制作人先生的伤能快点好起来……",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "kiriko",
        "text": "不过……如果能帮上忙的话，我很高兴……♪",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯，真的帮了大忙。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
